herdbook-spaces is a modified copy of the `spaces` mod shipped with the Herdr
desktop app 0.1.16 (https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app), licensed under
the Apache License 2.0 (LICENSE in this folder).

Changes from the original: a right-click opens herdbook-menu when it's
installed; on a Herdr build with cross-space drag functions (startDrag,
dragging, setDragSpace) it reports the space row or "+" under a drag with
setDragSpace. Without those functions it behaves as Herdr's spaces. Asset
paths were renamed by Herdr's mod.clone.
